[0.024802, "o", "Kernel 6.12.115+deb13.1-amd64: spinning on CPU 2, timing every gap > 300 ns, 30 s per run.\r\nLoad on CPUs 0,1,4,5. Waiting for the firmware to take the CPU away...\r\n\r\n"]
