[186.203071, "o", "  180 s    23073 gaps   largest    37.1 us   SMIs 1\r\n\r\n  SMI: CPU 2 was gone for 2.09 ms. The OS saw nothing; only the\r\n       firmware's SMI counter (MSR 0x34) moved, 4715 -> 4716.\r\n  That is 56x the largest gap Linux caused in the same run,\r\n  and no kernel setting can prevent it: it is this machine's latency floor.\r\n"]
